The subject doesn't have to be repeated in the message body.  The
subject should be an indicator of what the message is about; readers
can use it to decide whether they want to read the message or not.  The
message body contains the message you want them to read.

For a very short question, the two may be similar or identical, but
that's hardly the norm.

